{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1060266/block/singleImage/3248292/wm/01M5GCWXKN9BFRA1GKNW19JWXD.jpg?updatedAt=1792982590\"/><figcaption>本港地區今日(26日)天氣預測，大致天晴及乾燥，日間最高氣溫約30度，吹和緩東至東北風。(蘇文傑攝/資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>本港地區今日(26日)天氣預測，大致天晴及乾燥，日間最高氣溫約30度，吹和緩東至東北風。 展望未來一兩日風勢較大，部分時間有陽光。本周後期天晴，內陸地區日夜溫差頗大。 東北季候風會在今日影響廣東。而一股清勁至強風程度的偏東氣流會在本周中期逐漸影響華南沿岸，該區雲量稍多。隨著偏東氣流稍為緩和，本週後期廣東天色普遍晴朗，內陸地區日夜溫差頗大。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1060266/block/singleImage/3248296/df/01M5V1B19N4T64J0HJRHCEZK4F.png?updatedAt=1792982590\"/><figcaption>本港地區今日(26日)天氣預測，大致天晴及乾燥，日間最高氣溫約30度，吹和緩東至東北風。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:37.102335+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":271,"images":2,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T02:43:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T05:18:05.253368+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:40:23.797973+00:00","content_hash":"a26ca4abfa3438682ee82dad959e691858fcacbfbb6a0e8e8183a0a31c619cb4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:37.102335+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}